  "futureRequiredBindings": [
    "新authority/controller/plan exact SHA與獨立接受receipt",
    "canonical r34實際完成的4 identities、完整source/base pins、8步attempt/result/raw evidence及主管接受；stage identities不能代替final base",
    "候選version/id、專屬root、允許修改檔案、candidate source/resource/result/seal、獨立review pins",
    "現行policy/takeover與歷史prep seal分別綁定；包含F4 byte逆向證明",
    "新shared receipt由現任主管簽派，唯一整合者執行；release/入口啟用另授權"
  ],
  "constraints": [
    "只准42個exact gfx/weapon pair（control 0/0＋其餘41），own、Speed0/1、Brave0；remote/Slow/Speed2/3與native eligibility不擴張。",
    "按source sequence exact keys，不能用gfx0 sid/frame公式；gfx2796為48:1→48:2→48:3→8:0；六組terminal sid從8起；不鏡射方向。",
    "字典按gfx/sprite namespace；64裸key跨sprite collisions；不能只因gfx已支持就接受任意weapon。",
    "gfx0其他4武器共用已有24 pickup frames但profile hash/owner/combat timing仍獨立；base frame0取當前profile已驗hash，不跨profile借body。",
    "312 pickup key無shadow；先移除idle shadow，terminal只恢復own exact-key shadow；104 terminal unique shadow hits；PNG為body-only，不當完整composite expected。",
    "ActiveOwnCombat/WithProjectileHit/Timing.Matches保留；death無有限Duration，S87 weapon8循原base weapon0；projectile-hit即使OwnCombat=null仍優先，newer expired hit不得回退較舊attack。",
    "captured ActionCadence normal/haste不變；有Timing採AnimationMs否則appearance.Duration double；damage 583.3333333333334於583可見584到期，不用StepMs截整。",
    "owner/serial、S158/15逐筆、latest eligible replacement、terminal584、900/3000與權威數量沿final r34契約；切換weapon即使同body亦取消舊owner callbacks。",
    "metadata events inert，沒有新增音效/effect dispatch；104 base屬historical-selected-payload-matched，312 pickup/新增288屬current-idx-and-bounded-slice-only，不提升BIN/native資格。",
    "14 test families、2688 planned rows、7822重疊slots均不是執行數；產品runtime/build/native結果須另實跑、分項紀錄，不沿用本報告成功。"
